%% Terraform Deployment Diagram
graph TB
    DEV[environments/dev] -->|terraform init -backend-config| STATE[(S3 State Bucket, us-east-1\nkey: event-driven-platform/&lt;env&gt;/terraform.tfstate)]
    TEST[environments/test] --> STATE
    PROD[environments/prod] --> STATE

    PR[Pull Request] --> PLANWF[.github/workflows/plan.yml]
    PLANWF -->|OIDC AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity| OIDC[Landing Zone GitHub OIDC Provider]
    PLANWF --> PLANGUARD[scripts/plan-guard.sh]

    MAIN[Push to main / manual dispatch] --> APPLYWF[.github/workflows/apply.yml]
    APPLYWF -->|OIDC| OIDC
    APPLYWF --> APPLY[tofu apply]
    APPLY --> VALIDATE[validation/validate-event-platform.sh]

    SCAN[.github/workflows/security-scan.yml] --> TFLINT[tflint]
    SCAN --> CHECKOV[checkov]
